{
  "id": "ocrDemoFactures",
  "name": "OCR Demo — OCR.space",
  "active": true,
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Configuration\n\n1. Définir `OCRSPACE_API_KEY` dans les variables\n   d'environnement du serveur n8n, puis\n   **redémarrer n8n** : le nœud **OCR.space** la\n   lit via `$env`, il n'y a rien à saisir ici.\n\n2. **Activer** le workflow (bouton en haut à droite).\n\n3. Copier l'URL de production du nœud **Webhook**\n   et la coller dans `index.html`\n   (constante `WEBHOOK_URL` en haut du script).\n\nMoteur 2 obligatoire : le moteur 3 ne sait pas\nproduire de PDF consultable.\n\nSi le navigateur affiche une erreur CORS, voir la\nsection dédiée du README.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 380,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "Lisez-moi",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-260, -80]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "ocr",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {
          "allowedOrigins": "*"
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Webhook",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [180, 100],
      "webhookId": "b7c1e2d3-4f5a-4b6c-8d9e-0a1b2c3d4e5f"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.ocr.space/parse/image",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "apikey",
              "value": "={{ $env.OCRSPACE_API_KEY }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "sendBody": true,
        "contentType": "form-urlencoded",
        "bodyParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "base64Image",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.imageBase64 }}"
            },
            {
              "name": "language",
              "value": "fre"
            },
            {
              "name": "OCREngine",
              "value": "2"
            },
            {
              "name": "isCreateSearchablePdf",
              "value": "true"
            },
            {
              "name": "isSearchablePdfHideTextLayer",
              "value": "true"
            },
            {
              "name": "detectOrientation",
              "value": "true"
            },
            {
              "name": "scale",
              "value": "true"
            },
            {
              "name": "isTable",
              "value": "true"
            },
            {
              "name": "isOverlayRequired",
              "value": "false"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 120000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "OCR.space",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [400, 100],
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "c1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.IsErroredOnProcessing === true || !$json.SearchablePDFURL }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "boolean",
                "operation": "true",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "looseTypeValidation": true,
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000004",
      "name": "Erreur ?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [620, 100]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Normalise l'erreur OCR.space (ErrorMessage est tantôt string, tantôt array)\nconst r = $input.first().json;\nconst raw = r.ErrorMessage ?? r.ErrorDetails ?? r.message;\nconst message = (Array.isArray(raw) ? raw.join(' ') : raw) || 'Réponse OCR.space incomplète (pas de PDF consultable).';\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ok: false,\n    page: $('Webhook').first().json.body.page ?? 1,\n    error: String(message),\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000005",
      "name": "Formater erreur",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [860, -20]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "={{ $json.SearchablePDFURL }}",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 60000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "responseFormat": "file",
              "outputPropertyName": "data"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000006",
      "name": "Télécharger PDF",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [860, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// Selon N8N_DEFAULT_BINARY_DATA_MODE, `binary.data.data` contient soit le\n// base64, soit l'identifiant du stockage (« filesystem-v2 »). Le helper renvoie\n// les octets dans les deux cas.\nconst ocr = $('OCR.space').first().json;\nconst parsed = (ocr.ParsedResults ?? [])[0] ?? {};\nconst page = $('Webhook').first().json.body.page ?? 1;\n\nlet pdfBase64 = '';\ntry {\n  pdfBase64 = (await this.helpers.getBinaryDataBuffer(0, 'data')).toString('base64');\n} catch (e) {\n  return [{ json: { ok: false, page, error: 'Lecture du PDF impossible : ' + e.message } }];\n}\n\n// JVBER = « %PDF » en base64 : garde-fou contre une page d'erreur HTML\nif (!pdfBase64.startsWith('JVBER')) {\n  return [{ json: { ok: false, page, error: 'La réponse n\\u2019est pas un PDF valide.' } }];\n}\n\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    ok: true,\n    page,\n    text: parsed.ParsedText ?? '',\n    exitCode: parsed.FileParseExitCode ?? null,\n    ms: Number(ocr.ProcessingTimeInMilliseconds ?? 0),\n    pdfBase64,\n  },\n}];"
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000007",
      "name": "Formater",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [1080, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "firstIncomingItem",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "a1000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000008",
      "name": "Répondre",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [1320, 100]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Webhook": {
